    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "scar on skin",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她低头看自己的手。左手无名指——那个从小就在的疤痕，外婆说是她两岁时被热牛奶烫的——还在。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian struggles to remember",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "faint mark",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "但旁边多了一道浅浅的、她不记得什么时候出现的印痕。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian struggles to remember",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "faint mark",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "不对。那道印痕一直在吗？\n她想不起来。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "多少钱？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "男人已经站起来，在手机上打字。他头也不抬：\"多少钱？\"\n\"二十八。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
