    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他扫了码，走了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks through the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "……那家店……合同都准备好了……",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "lipstick mark",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "苏念看着他走进对面写字楼的旋转门，消失在玻璃幕墙后面。\n她低头再看那杯美式。杯沿有一个淡淡的口红印——不是她的，她今天没涂口红。\n那是谁的？\n她想不起来刚才发生"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "说的是哪家店？"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian turns on the faucet",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "lipstick mark",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念把杯子放进水池。水龙头打开，热水冲掉口红印，冲掉水汽，冲掉一切。\n她擦干手，看了看左手无名指。"
  },
  {
